# ---- Rust ----
target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Cargo.lock IS committed, deliberately.
# Since 2023 the Cargo book recommends committing it for libraries too:
# it makes CI reproducible and makes `cargo audit` results meaningful.
# Do not add Cargo.lock here.

# ---- Fuzzing ----
fuzz/target/
fuzz/artifacts/
# fuzz/corpus/ IS committed — see docs/05-testing-strategy.md §4

# ---- Coverage ----
*.profraw
*.profdata
lcov.info
coverage/
tarpaulin-report.*

# ---- WASM / npm ----
node_modules/
crates/kontera-wasm/pkg/
npm/pkg/
npm/dist/
*.tgz
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# ---- Secrets and credentials ----
# CI publishes to crates.io and npm with scoped tokens (07 §6).
# Nothing token-shaped belongs in the repo.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
.npmrc
credentials.toml

# ---- Generated SIE output ----
# Golden fixtures are committed; anything generated at runtime is not.
*.si
*.se
!fixtures/**/*.si
!fixtures/**/*.se
/out/

# ---- Real merchant data ----
# Event logs from a live shop contain order and buyer data, and are
# räkenskapsinformation belonging to the merchant — not to this repo.
# Keep experiments with real data in /local/, which is never tracked.
/local/
/scratch/
*.real.jsonl
*.private.toml

# ---- Claude Project working files ----
# These live in the Claude Project (Instructions field + Context), not in
# the public repo. Kept locally beside the code, never pushed.
/STATE.md
/PROJECT-INSTRUCTIONS.md

# ---- Editor ----
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.netrwhist
Session.vim
.direnv/
.envrc

# ---- OS ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---- tags ----
.tags
tags
